{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 18, "text": "开播前，我习惯先花两分钟热一下嗓子。", "t0": 678246.806851, "t1": 678246.814579, "dur_ms": 7.73, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:07", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 1.12], ["l2_named_copy", 5.74], ["l3_progress_cb", 7.72]], "audio_ms": 5120, "cached": true, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "这一步很关键，能少很多干涩和紧张。", "t0": 678246.834212, "t1": 678252.650577, "dur_ms": 5816.37, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:13", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.5], ["s3_tmpdir", 22.53], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 22.58], ["s5_infer", 5767.48], ["s6_guard", 5768.35], ["s7_save_wav", 5774.36], ["s8_write_cache", 5792.67], ["s9_vram", 5794.29], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5794.3], ["l2_named_copy", 5814.94], ["l3_progress_cb", 5816.36]], "audio_ms": 5240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "你一般怎么做，是先喝温水吗？", "t0": 678252.671422, "t1": 678256.9578, "dur_ms": 4286.38, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:17", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.09], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.1], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.46], ["s3_tmpdir", 21.26], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 21.31], ["s5_infer", 4235.48], ["s6_guard", 4236.31], ["s7_save_wav", 4240.84], ["s8_write_cache", 4260.42], ["s9_vram", 4261.45], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4261.48], ["l2_named_copy", 4284.93], ["l3_progress_cb", 4286.37]], "audio_ms": 3560, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "先喝温水，再轻轻哼几声，别用力喊。", "t0": 678256.977946, "t1": 678264.658676, "dur_ms": 7680.73, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:25", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.07], ["s0_enter", 0.08], ["s1_load", 0.08], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.57], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.42], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.45], ["s5_infer", 7629.84], ["s6_guard", 7630.44], ["s7_save_wav", 7635.74], ["s8_write_cache", 7655.77], ["s9_vram", 7656.39], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 7656.4], ["l2_named_copy", 7679.33], ["l3_progress_cb", 7680.73]], "audio_ms": 7040, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "我还会慢慢念一段绕口令，找找节奏。", "t0": 678264.679581, "t1": 678268.806327, "dur_ms": 4126.75, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:29", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.12], ["s0_enter", 0.13], ["s1_load", 0.13], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.65], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.4], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.43], ["s5_infer", 4077.27], ["s6_guard", 4077.93], ["s7_save_wav", 4083.03], ["s8_write_cache", 4102.38], ["s9_vram", 4103.07], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4103.09], ["l2_named_copy", 4125.29], ["l3_progress_cb", 4126.74]], "audio_ms": 3320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "对，放松比飙高音重要，舒服就够了。", "t0": 678268.826681, "t1": 678274.82472, "dur_ms": 5998.04, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:35", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.48], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.63], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.68], ["s5_infer", 5937.68], ["s6_guard", 5938.36], ["s7_save_wav", 5946.76], ["s8_write_cache", 5971.03], ["s9_vram", 5971.75], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5971.77], ["l2_named_copy", 5996.57], ["l3_progress_cb", 5998.03]], "audio_ms": 5400, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "那时间紧的时候，有没有更快的办法？", "t0": 678274.848021, "t1": 678279.03061, "dur_ms": 4182.59, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:40", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.36], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.33], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.36], ["s5_infer", 4132.47], ["s6_guard", 4133.34], ["s7_save_wav", 4138.77], ["s8_write_cache", 4157.37], ["s9_vram", 4158.0], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4158.35], ["l2_named_copy", 4181.18], ["l3_progress_cb", 4182.59]], "audio_ms": 3440, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "深呼吸几次，再念一句话，也能应急。", "t0": 678279.051151, "t1": 678284.35329, "dur_ms": 5302.14, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:06:45", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.64], ["s3_tmpdir", 2.21], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 2.26], ["s5_infer", 5247.58], ["s6_guard", 5248.21], ["s7_save_wav", 5256.5], ["s8_write_cache", 5276.15], ["s9_vram", 5276.82], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5276.83], ["l2_named_copy", 5300.66], ["l3_progress_cb", 5302.14]], "audio_ms": 4600, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 1, "speaker": "A", "chars": 22, "text": "你有没有想过，飞机起飞前为什么非要收小桌板？", "t0": 678303.400565, "t1": 678308.479523, "dur_ms": 5078.96, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:09", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.06], ["s0_enter", 0.07], ["s1_load", 0.07], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.58], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.33], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.37], ["s5_infer", 5026.26], ["s6_guard", 5026.94], ["s7_save_wav", 5034.84], ["s8_write_cache", 5054.91], ["s9_vram", 5055.59], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5055.6], ["l2_named_copy", 5077.49], ["l3_progress_cb", 5078.95]], "audio_ms": 4600, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 2, "speaker": "B", "chars": 20, "text": "很多人以为是怕挡路，其实核心是安全考虑。", "t0": 678308.501079, "t1": 678314.178574, "dur_ms": 5677.49, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:15", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.54], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.44], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.48], ["s5_infer", 5626.02], ["s6_guard", 5626.68], ["s7_save_wav", 5631.68], ["s8_write_cache", 5652.06], ["s9_vram", 5652.81], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5652.82], ["l2_named_copy", 5676.07], ["l3_progress_cb", 5677.49]], "audio_ms": 5240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 3, "speaker": "A", "chars": 3, "text": "安全？", "t0": 678314.202253, "t1": 678316.568392, "dur_ms": 2366.14, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:17", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.69], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.77], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.81], ["s5_infer", 2314.95], ["s6_guard", 2315.63], ["s7_save_wav", 2320.42], ["s8_write_cache", 2340.28], ["s9_vram", 2340.9], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 2340.92], ["l2_named_copy", 2364.74], ["l3_progress_cb", 2366.14]], "audio_ms": 1240, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 4, "speaker": "A", "chars": 15, "text": "一块小小的板子能有多大影响呢？", "t0": 678316.589388, "t1": 678320.478461, "dur_ms": 3889.07, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:21", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.55], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.37], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.41], ["s5_infer", 3835.44], ["s6_guard", 3836.05], ["s7_save_wav", 3844.2], ["s8_write_cache", 3863.99], ["s9_vram", 3864.67], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3864.69], ["l2_named_copy", 3887.66], ["l3_progress_cb", 3889.07]], "audio_ms": 3320, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 5, "speaker": "B", "chars": 16, "text": "起降是飞行中最容易出状况的阶段。", "t0": 678320.500461, "t1": 678325.950616, "dur_ms": 5450.16, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:26", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.68], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.83], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.87], ["s5_infer", 5397.36], ["s6_guard", 5398.09], ["s7_save_wav", 5406.52], ["s8_write_cache", 5425.71], ["s9_vram", 5426.34], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5426.36], ["l2_named_copy", 5448.72], ["l3_progress_cb", 5450.15]], "audio_ms": 4800, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 6, "speaker": "A", "chars": 17, "text": "我听说这段时间特别短，也特别紧张。", "t0": 678325.971911, "t1": 678331.254242, "dur_ms": 5282.33, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:32", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.49], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.66], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.7], ["s5_infer", 5231.83], ["s6_guard", 5232.74], ["s7_save_wav", 5237.25], ["s8_write_cache", 5256.51], ["s9_vram", 5257.16], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5257.18], ["l2_named_copy", 5280.78], ["l3_progress_cb", 5282.32]], "audio_ms": 4760, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 7, "speaker": "B", "chars": 20, "text": "一旦要紧急刹车或撤离，留给你的时间很紧。", "t0": 678331.275684, "t1": 678336.520471, "dur_ms": 5244.79, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:37", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.46], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.08], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.11], ["s5_infer", 5190.61], ["s6_guard", 5191.25], ["s7_save_wav", 5198.28], ["s8_write_cache", 5219.69], ["s9_vram", 5220.42], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5220.43], ["l2_named_copy", 5243.09], ["l3_progress_cb", 5244.78]], "audio_ms": 4640, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 8, "speaker": "A", "chars": 20, "text": "所以桌板收起来，是为了让人能快速站起来。", "t0": 678336.540579, "t1": 678342.874021, "dur_ms": 6333.44, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:43", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.6], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.73], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.78], ["s5_infer", 6279.23], ["s6_guard", 6280.1], ["s7_save_wav", 6288.31], ["s8_write_cache", 6308.26], ["s9_vram", 6308.91], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6308.93], ["l2_named_copy", 6331.71], ["l3_progress_cb", 6333.44]], "audio_ms": 5760, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 9, "speaker": "B", "chars": 21, "text": "对，还怕它顶住你的身体，造成不必要的内伤。", "t0": 678342.893779, "t1": 678348.18935, "dur_ms": 5295.57, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:49", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.1], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.11], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.61], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.72], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.77], ["s5_infer", 5241.81], ["s6_guard", 5242.48], ["s7_save_wav", 5250.63], ["s8_write_cache", 5269.16], ["s9_vram", 5269.81], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5269.83], ["l2_named_copy", 5294.06], ["l3_progress_cb", 5295.57]], "audio_ms": 4720, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 10, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "我懂了，就像坐车要系安全带一样。", "t0": 678348.20979, "t1": 678353.170763, "dur_ms": 4960.97, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:07:54", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.63], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.57], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.6], ["s5_infer", 4911.51], ["s6_guard", 4912.14], ["s7_save_wav", 4917.6], ["s8_write_cache", 4936.79], ["s9_vram", 4937.42], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4937.44], ["l2_named_copy", 4959.5], ["l3_progress_cb", 4960.97]], "audio_ms": 4480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 11, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "还有个原因，是给逃生通道让出空间。", "t0": 678353.191772, "t1": 678359.290953, "dur_ms": 6099.18, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:00", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.52], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.27], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.3], ["s5_infer", 6048.15], ["s6_guard", 6048.76], ["s7_save_wav", 6056.74], ["s8_write_cache", 6075.25], ["s9_vram", 6075.89], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 6075.91], ["l2_named_copy", 6097.71], ["l3_progress_cb", 6099.18]], "audio_ms": 5600, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 12, "speaker": "A", "chars": 16, "text": "过道本来就窄，桌板一放就更挤了。", "t0": 678359.311838, "t1": 678364.199388, "dur_ms": 4887.55, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:05", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.68], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.83], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.88], ["s5_infer", 4833.26], ["s6_guard", 4833.86], ["s7_save_wav", 4842.08], ["s8_write_cache", 4861.42], ["s9_vram", 4862.07], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4862.08], ["l2_named_copy", 4885.66], ["l3_progress_cb", 4887.54]], "audio_ms": 4280, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 13, "speaker": "B", "chars": 17, "text": "是的，撤离的时候，每一秒都很关键。", "t0": 678364.218981, "t1": 678369.608356, "dur_ms": 5389.38, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:10", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.59], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.93], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.98], ["s5_infer", 5338.71], ["s6_guard", 5339.44], ["s7_save_wav", 5343.98], ["s8_write_cache", 5364.49], ["s9_vram", 5365.6], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5365.62], ["l2_named_copy", 5387.92], ["l3_progress_cb", 5389.37]], "audio_ms": 4800, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 14, "speaker": "A", "chars": 14, "text": "那椅背为什么也一定要调直呢？", "t0": 678369.62947, "t1": 678373.641493, "dur_ms": 4012.02, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:14", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.11], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.37], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.49], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.53], ["s5_infer", 3963.02], ["s6_guard", 3963.72], ["s7_save_wav", 3968.43], ["s8_write_cache", 3988.08], ["s9_vram", 3988.76], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 3988.78], ["l2_named_copy", 4010.57], ["l3_progress_cb", 4012.02]], "audio_ms": 3360, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 15, "speaker": "B", "chars": 18, "text": "调直能让后排的人更快离开自己的座位。", "t0": 678373.661505, "t1": 678379.287482, "dur_ms": 5625.98, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:20", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.37], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.41], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.45], ["s5_infer", 5572.71], ["s6_guard", 5573.33], ["s7_save_wav", 5581.79], ["s8_write_cache", 5600.52], ["s9_vram", 5601.18], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5601.2], ["l2_named_copy", 5624.57], ["l3_progress_cb", 5625.97]], "audio_ms": 4960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 16, "speaker": "A", "chars": 18, "text": "原来这些规定，都是一整套配合起来的。", "t0": 678379.307915, "t1": 678384.130306, "dur_ms": 4822.39, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:25", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.08], ["s0_enter", 0.09], ["s1_load", 0.09], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.47], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.4], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.43], ["s5_infer", 4769.31], ["s6_guard", 4770.02], ["s7_save_wav", 4778.32], ["s8_write_cache", 4797.83], ["s9_vram", 4798.48], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4798.49], ["l2_named_copy", 4820.93], ["l3_progress_cb", 4822.39]], "audio_ms": 4080, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 17, "speaker": "B", "chars": 19, "text": "对，还有遮光板和行李架，道理是相通的。", "t0": 678384.151172, "t1": 678389.714986, "dur_ms": 5563.81, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:30", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.37], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.38], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.42], ["s5_infer", 5514.13], ["s6_guard", 5514.89], ["s7_save_wav", 5520.92], ["s8_write_cache", 5539.25], ["s9_vram", 5539.91], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 5539.92], ["l2_named_copy", 5562.12], ["l3_progress_cb", 5563.81]], "audio_ms": 4960, "cached": false, "ok": true}
{"seg": 18, "speaker": "A", "chars": 15, "text": "都是为了关键时刻，少一点阻碍。", "t0": 678389.735249, "t1": 678393.853093, "dur_ms": 4117.84, "wall": "2026-09-18T12:08:34", "llm_end": null, "marks": [["l1_cache_key", 0.11], ["s0_enter", 0.12], ["s1_load", 0.12], ["s2_cache_lookup", 0.37], ["s3_tmpdir", 1.56], ["s4_empty_cache_pre", 1.6], ["s5_infer", 4062.58], ["s6_guard", 4063.18], ["s7_save_wav", 4070.65], ["s8_write_cache", 4090.91], ["s9_vram", 4091.67], ["s10_empty_cache_post", 4092.02], ["l2_named_copy", 4115.82], ["l3_progress_cb", 4117.84]], "audio_ms": 3480, "cached": false, "ok": true}
